Principal author of the ((lessons)).  See [http://neptune.spaceports.com/~words/lojban.html].

Synonyms: Robin the Turk, Robin.TR:
* he is not an ethnic Turk
* he is English
* he lives in ((Turkey))
* his mailing address ends in .tr
* Suffixing him with .tr helps distinguish him from ((Robin Lee Powell))
** Who is sometimes called Robin.CA, because he is originally Canadian and lives in California.
